---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="404: Página no encontrada | Od. Alexis Torres"
  description="La página que buscas no existe o ha sido movida. Te invitamos a volver al inicio del consultorio dental del Od. Alexis Torres en Xalapa, Ver."
>
  <section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-white pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-36 md:pb-32 min-h-[85vh] flex items-center">
    <!-- Decoración sutil de fondo -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-40">
      <div class="h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-[#0D214B]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center">
      <!-- Badge de error -->
      <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#0D214B] shadow-xs">
        Error 404
      </span>

      <!-- Número 404 estilizado -->
      <div class="mt-6 mb-4">
        <h1 class="text-8xl sm:text-9xl md:text-[11rem] font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-slate-900 select-none">
          4<span class="text-[#4E8C41]">0</span>4
        </h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Mensaje principal -->
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 md:text-4xl">
        Parece que esta página no existe
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-500 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        El enlace que seguiste pudo haber cambiado o ya no está disponible. No te preocupes, puedes volver al inicio o explorar nuestros tratamientos dentales.
      </p>

      <!-- Botones de acción principales -->
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-4 rounded-full bg-[#0D214B] py-2.5 pl-7 pr-2 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-95 hover:bg-[#1a3875]"
        >
          Volver al inicio
          <span
            class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#0D214B] shadow-xs"
          >
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
              class="h-4 w-4"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"
              />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/#servicios"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-xs hover:border-[#0D214B] hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-[#0D214B] transition-all"
        >
          Ver servicios
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta de contacto / ayuda -->
      <div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto shadow-xs">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
          ¿Necesitas ayuda o deseas agendar tu visita?
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-sm">
          <a
            href="tel:+522223085239"
            class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-[#4E8C41] transition-colors"
          >
            <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-xs text-[#4E8C41] border border-slate-200/60">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.5 4.5a3 3 0 013-3h1.372c.86 0 1.61.586 1.819 1.42l1.105 4.423a1.875 1.875 0 01-.694 1.955l-1.293.97c-.135.101-.164.249-.126.352a11.285 11.285 0 006.697 6.697c.103.038.25.009.352-.126l.97-1.293a1.875 1.875 0 011.955-.694l4.423 1.105c.834.209 1.42.959 1.42 1.82V19.5a3 3 0 01-3 3h-2.25C8.552 22.5 1.5 15.448 1.5 6.75V4.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            222-308-52-39
          </a>

          <a
            href="mailto:cd.alexisto@gmail.com"
            class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-[#4E8C41] transition-colors"
          >
            <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-xs text-[#4E8C41] border border-slate-200/60">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            cd.alexisto@gmail.com
          </a>

          <a
            href="/#contacto"
            class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold text-[#0D214B] hover:text-[#4E8C41] transition-colors"
          >
            <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0D214B] text-white shadow-xs">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            Agendar cita
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
